{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xplorite</strong> is a action-exploration metroidvania set on the planet <strong>Nargal</strong>, home to the almost extint <strong>Anunnis</strong>, a beautiful but dangerous place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to investigate the disappearance of the research team sent by the <strong>G.S.O,</strong>\u00a0while trying to avoid the hazards of this world and the robotic enemies populating its areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For your mission to succeed you will need all the help you can get, and you will find it here in the form of abilities, modules and upgrades. Each will improve or change the way you fight your way to the <strong>A.I.</strong> Tower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planet to find places to improve your abilities, lots of power to be gained</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/e879328dc0975d44e8517264292b6a5e.poster.avif?t=1770207600\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/e879328dc0975d44e8517264292b6a5e.webm?t=1770207600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/e879328dc0975d44e8517264292b6a5e.mp4?t=1770207600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against aggressive robots under the influence of an evil <strong>A.I.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/4baf8bec150a26ca774d5f4dda2867aa.poster.avif?t=1770207600\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/4baf8bec150a26ca774d5f4dda2867aa.webm?t=1770207600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/4baf8bec150a26ca774d5f4dda2867aa.mp4?t=1770207600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABILITIES, MODULES &amp; ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your abilities and gain more power by collecting items through the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/9f35dc80731a62dadb63d5079b46fffa.avif?t=1770207600\" width=770 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRONES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your combat with different Drones as they expand your abilities when equipped</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/d53db885e4b6ad17373149a2c5b20d28.avif?t=1770207600\" width=770 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NPCs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with the locals to find out more about the planet, they might help you out in your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720230/extras/bdb9f7836555814a59817cecc5106747.avif?t=1770207600\" width=770 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2720230?t=1770207600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2720230?t=1770207600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st